{"step_index":3078,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T15:20:06Z","thinking":"Changes were made to ensure the next queued process automatically launches after the current one finishes, even if errors occur, via a `finally:` block. A specific event is now dispatched when a queued job starts. The process deletion now correctly removes the process from the queue.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"C:\\Users\\kakak\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\walkthrough.md","EndLine":100,"StartLine":1,"toolAction":"Viewing walkthrough artifact","toolSummary":"View walkthrough.md"}}]}
{"step_index":3079,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T15:20:10Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-22T18:20:10+03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-22T18:20:10+03:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/walkthrough.md`\nTotal Lines: 78\nTotal Bytes: 4996\nShowing lines 1 to 78\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # Walkthrough: Dynamic Summary Formulas, Review Real-time Sync, Global Progress Modal & Production Deployment\n2: \n3: All requested enhancements, bug fixes, and production packaging have been implemented and verified end-to-end.\n4: \n5: ---\n6: \n7: ## 1. Dynamic Excel Summary Formulas (`ملخص`)\n8: - **Implemented Dynamic Formulas**:\n9:   - `إجمالي الأصناف المطلوبة`: `=B3+B4+B5`\n10:   - `تم مطابقتها`: `=SUM(B8:B{7+N})` (sums warehouse matched counts)\n11:   - `لم يُعثر عليها`: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('لم يُعثر عليه'!A:A)-1)`\n12:   - `تحتاج مراجعة`: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('يحتاج مراجعة'!A:A)-1)`\n13:   - Warehouse details table (rows 8+):\n14:     - Col 2: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('{sheet}'!A:A)-1)`\n15:     - Col 3: `=COUNTIF('يحتاج مراجعة'!D:D, \"{warehouse_name}\")`\n16:   - Percentages formatted dynamically with `=IF(B2>0, B3/B2, 0)` and formatted as `0.0%`.\n17: - **Confidence Values in Arabic**:\n18:   - Replaced technical codes (`exact`, `high`, `llm`) with professional Arabic terms:\n19:     - `تطابق تام (100%)`\n20:     - `تطابق نصي دقيق (X%)`\n21:     - `مطابقة ذكية (AI)`\n22:     - `تأكيد يدوي (مراجعة)`\n23: \n24: ---\n25: \n26: ## 2. Review Workflow & UI Synchronization\n27: - **Fixed Toast Message (`undefined` bug)**:\n28:   - Fixed toast message in `applyReviews()`: now clearly shows:\n29:     `تم تنفيذ التعديلات! تم اعتماد: X مطابق، Y غير متوفر، والمتبقي للمراجعة: Z`.\n30: - **Instant Stat Cards Refresh**:\n31:   - `backend.apply_reviews` now returns `new_stats` (`total`, `matched_count`, `not_found_count`, `review_count`).\n32:   - Calls `loadResults(result.new_stats)` so the 4 stat cards update on screen immediately without leaving the screen.\n33: - **Excel Synchronization**:\n34:   - `apply_reviews` updates the `ملخص` sheet cells, updates `history.db`, and saves the workbook cleanly.\n35: \n36: ---\n37: \n38: ## 3. Global Re-Run Modal Overlay & Concurrency Lock\n39: - **Global Modal Overlay**:\n40:   - Moved `#progress-modal` from inside `screen-new` to a fixed full-screen backdrop overlay (`position: fixed; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; z-index: 99999;`).\n41:   - When clicking \"إعادة المطابقة (Re-run)\" from the results screen, the modal pops up immediately over the screen with a live timer, progress bar, and spinner.\n42:   - Added a button inside the modal allowing the user to view the Terminal logs if desired.\n43: - **Concurrency Protection**:\n44:   - Added `isProcessRunning` state check in frontend: prevents clicking \"بدء عملية المطابقة\" while a process is running.\n45:   - Added thread lock `self._worker_lock` and running check in backend: `start_process`, `restart_process`, and `rerun_process` will safely reject concurrent runs with a clear warning.\n46: \n47: ---\n48: \n49: ## 4. Pharmaceutical Rules Tuning in AI Prompt\n50: - **Brand vs Generic / Alternative Substitution**:\n51:   - Drugs with the same active ingredient and strength but different trade names (e.g. Roaccutane vs generic Isotretinoin, or Zovirax vs Lovir) are now correctly routed to **\"يحتاج مراجعة\"** with the reason:\n52:     `\"بديل تجاري / مثيل: نفس المادة الفعالة والتركيز ولكن الاسم التجاري مختلف (المطلوب: [اسم]، المتوفر: [اسم])\"`.\n53: - **Identical Counts / Manufacturer Suffix**:\n54:   - Equal counts (e.g. 3 ampoules == ٣ امبولات) and items where the only difference is the manufacturer suffix (`/نوفارتس`, `/اكاديميا`) are now recognized as **100% confirmed matches** instead of going to review.\n55: \n56: ---\n57: \n58: ## 5. Production Packaging (`dist_production/`)\n59: - Created `scripts/package_production.py` which builds a clean, standalone distribution in `dist_production/`:\n60:   - Contains only runtime files (`desktop_app/`, `src/`, `fast_main.py`, `requirements.txt`, `.env.example`).\n61:   - Contains fresh, clean `data/` directory with initialized `history.db`.\n62:   - Includes `run_app.bat` (1-click Windows launcher that auto-installs requirements and starts the app).\n63:   - Includes `README_SETUP.md` with complete, easy-to-follow Arabic setup instructions for the pharmacy computer.\n64: \n65: ---\n66: \n67: ## 6. Verification Results\n68: \n69: | Component / Test | Result |\n70: | :--- | :--- |\n71: | **Excel Summary Formulas** | PASSED: Dynamic Excel formulas `=B3+B4+B5`, `=SUM(...)`, `=COUNTA(...)` generated and verified |\n72: | **Confidence Arabic Names** | PASSED: Shows `تطابق تام (100%)`, `تطابق نصي دقيق (97%)`, `مطابقة ذكية (AI)` |\n73: | **Review Sync & Toast** | PASSED: Returns `new_stats`, updates cards instantly, no `undefined` in toast |\n74: | **Brand vs Generic Routing** | PASSED: Roaccutane vs Isotretinoin, Zovirax vs Lovir routed to `يحتاج مراجعة` with Arabic reason |\n75: | **Identical Count Matching** | PASSED: Voltaren 3 ampoules / Novartis matched directly |\n76: | **Concurrency Protection** | PASSED: Concurrent process execution blocked in backend and UI |\n77: | **Production Packaging** | PASSED: Standalone `dist_production/` folder created with `run_app.bat` and `README_SETUP.md` |\n78: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
{"step_index":3080,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T15:20:10Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Update walkthrough artifact with queue, UI modal position, and cleanup details","EndLine":78,"Instruction":"Add sections for queue, left-aligned modal overlay, and cleanup to walkthrough","ReplacementContent":"## 3. Left-Aligned Modal Overlay & Process Queue System (نظام قائمة الانتظار)\n- **Left-Side UI Modal Overlay**:\n  - Moved `#progress-modal` to `.main-content` with `position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%;`.\n  - In RTL layout, it now covers only the left work area (`نص الشمال`), leaving the right sidebar completely accessible and usable at all times.\n- **Background Process Queuing (`كيو`)**:\n  - When a matching run or re-run is actively running, submitting a new matching process no longer fails or blocks.\n  - The new process is automatically saved with status `'queued'` (`في الانتظار`) and added to the backend FIFO queue.\n  - The new process submission form resets immediately and displays an informative toast:\n    `تمت إضافة العملية إلى قائمة الانتظار (الترتيب #1)، وستبدأ تلقائياً فور انتهاء العملية الحالية.`\n  - The History screen displays the queued process with an amber badge `في الانتظار` along with a cancel/delete button.\n  - As soon as the active process finishes, a `finally:` block in `_process_worker` automatically pops and executes the next process in queue without requiring manual intervention, and emits `process_queued_started` to notify the frontend.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Discrepancy Bug Fix (Review Count 9 vs 16)\n- **Root Cause**: `FastCoordinator.process()` previously subtracted items matched in other warehouses from `review_count`, yielding 9, whereas `excel_writer.py` wrote all warehouse review candidates to the `يحتاج مراجعة` sheet (16 rows), causing a mismatch between the initial summary and Excel/database.\n- **Resolution**: Aligned `coordinator.py` summary statistics to match the exact row count of the Excel sheets (`total_wh_matched`, `total_review_items`, and `total_not_found`).\n\n---\n\n## 5. Pharmaceutical Rules Tuning in AI Prompt\n- **Brand vs Generic / Alternative Substitution**:\n  - Drugs with the same active ingredient and strength but different trade names (e.g. Roaccutane vs generic Isotretinoin, or Zovirax vs Lovir) are now correctly routed to **\"يحتاج مراجعة\"** with the reason:\n    `\"بديل تجاري / مثيل: نفس المادة الفعالة والتركيز ولكن الاسم التجاري مختلف (المطلوب: [اسم]، المتوفر: [اسم])\"`.\n- **Identical Counts / Manufacturer Suffix**:\n  - Equal counts (e.g. 3 ampoules == ٣ امبولات) and items where the only difference is the manufacturer suffix (`/نوفارتس`, `/اكاديميا`) are now recognized as **100% confirmed matches** instead of going to review.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Complete Environment Cleanup\n- Deleted all Unstructured API result files (`transform-result-*.json`).\n- Cleared the `processes` history table in `data/history.db`.\n- Cleaned out all previous process directories under `data/processes/`.\n- Re-packaged a fresh, clean distribution in `dist_production/`.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Verification Results\n\n| Component / Test | Result |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Excel Summary Formulas** | PASSED: Dynamic Excel formulas `=B3+B4+B5`, `=SUM(...)`, `=COUNTA(...)` generated and verified |\n| **Confidence Arabic Names** | PASSED: Shows `تطابق تام (100%)`, `تطابق نصي دقيق (97%)`, `مطابقة ذكية (AI)` |\n| **Review Sync & Toast** | PASSED: Returns `new_stats`, updates cards instantly, no `undefined` in toast |\n| **Review Count Alignment** | PASSED: Coordinator summary matches Excel row count (16 == 16) |\n| **Left-Side Modal Overlay** | PASSED: Bounded inside `.main-content`, leaves sidebar accessible |\n| **Process Queue Mechanics** | PASSED: Tested auto-start from queue (`['PROC-001', 'PROC-002']`) and queue removal |\n| **Brand vs Generic Routing** | PASSED: Roaccutane vs Isotretinoin, Zovirax vs Lovir routed to `يحتاج مراجعة` |\n| **Identical Count Matching** | PASSED: Voltaren 3 ampoules / Novartis matched directly |\n| **Environment Cleanup** | PASSED: History and temporary process files cleaned completely |\n| **Production Packaging** | PASSED: Standalone `dist_production/` folder created with `run_app.bat` and `README_SETUP.md` |","StartLine":38,"TargetContent":"## 3. Global Re-Run Modal Overlay & Concurrency Lock\n- **Global Modal Overlay**:\n  - Moved `#progress-modal` from inside `screen-new` to a fixed full-screen backdrop overlay (`position: fixed; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; z-index: 99999;`).\n  - When clicking \"إعادة المطابقة (Re-run)\" from the results screen, the modal pops up immediately over the screen with a live timer, progress bar, and spinner.\n  - Added a button inside the modal allowing the user to view the Terminal logs if desired.\n- **Concurrency Protection**:\n  - Added `isProcessRunning` state check in frontend: prevents clicking \"بدء عملية المطابقة\" while a process is running.\n  - Added thread lock `self._worker_lock` and running check in backend: `start_process`, `restart_process`, and `rerun_process` will safely reject concurrent runs with a clear warning.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Pharmaceutical Rules Tuning in AI Prompt\n- **Brand vs Generic / Alternative Substitution**:\n  - Drugs with the same active ingredient and strength but different trade names (e.g. Roaccutane vs generic Isotretinoin, or Zovirax vs Lovir) are now correctly routed to **\"يحتاج مراجعة\"** with the reason:\n    `\"بديل تجاري / مثيل: نفس المادة الفعالة والتركيز ولكن الاسم التجاري مختلف (المطلوب: [اسم]، المتوفر: [اسم])\"`.\n- **Identical Counts / Manufacturer Suffix**:\n  - Equal counts (e.g. 3 ampoules == ٣ امبولات) and items where the only difference is the manufacturer suffix (`/نوفارتس`, `/اكاديميا`) are now recognized as **100% confirmed matches** instead of going to review.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Production Packaging (`dist_production/`)\n- Created `scripts/package_production.py` which builds a clean, standalone distribution in `dist_production/`:\n  - Contains only runtime files (`desktop_app/`, `src/`, `fast_main.py`, `requirements.txt`, `.env.example`).\n  - Contains fresh, clean `data/` directory with initialized `history.db`.\n  - Includes `run_app.bat` (1-click Windows launcher that auto-installs requirements and starts the app).\n  - Includes `README_SETUP.md` with complete, easy-to-follow Arabic setup instructions for the pharmacy computer.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Verification Results\n\n| Component / Test | Result |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Excel Summary Formulas** | PASSED: Dynamic Excel formulas `=B3+B4+B5`, `=SUM(...)`, `=COUNTA(...)` generated and verified |\n| **Confidence Arabic Names** | PASSED: Shows `تطابق تام (100%)`, `تطابق نصي دقيق (97%)`, `مطابقة ذكية (AI)` |\n| **Review Sync & Toast** | PASSED: Returns `new_stats`, updates cards instantly, no `undefined` in toast |\n| **Brand vs Generic Routing** | PASSED: Roaccutane vs Isotretinoin, Zovirax vs Lovir routed to `يحتاج مراجعة` with Arabic reason |\n| **Identical Count Matching** | PASSED: Voltaren 3 ampoules / Novartis matched directly |\n| **Concurrency Protection** | PASSED: Concurrent process execution blocked in backend and UI |\n| **Production Packaging** | PASSED: Standalone `dist_production/` folder created with `run_app.bat` and `README_SETUP.md` |","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\kakak\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Editing walkthrough.md","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough with queue and cleanup details"}}]}
